# Factor-Alpha Screener — optional local secrets.
#
# The platform runs fully WITHOUT this file. It only enables the AI features
# (the AI-exposure agent + the "how to read" explainer).
#
# To enable them:
#   1. Copy this file to ".env"   (same folder)
#   2. Paste YOUR OWN Gemini API key below (get a free one: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey)
#   3. Restart the app.
#
# ".env" is gitignored — your key stays on your machine and is NEVER committed or pushed.
# Each person uses their own key; do not share one key inside the repo.

GEMINI_API_KEY=
